        p.a-subtitle Table 14-2
        p.m-data-table__caption
          | Behavioral Correlates of Benzodiazepine Dependence.
          a(href='#t14_2fn1', data-behavior='ShowPopupTip') *
        .m-data-table__table-container
          table.m-data-table__table(role='grid')
            colgroup(span='1')
              col#t14_2col1(width='100.00%', span='1')
            tbody.m-data-table__tbody
              tr.m-data-table__row
                td.m-data-table__entry.m-data-table__txlr-borders.m-data-table__hanging01(align='left', valign='top', rowspan='1', colspan='1')
                  | People who have become dependent on therapeutic doses of benzodiazepines usually have
                  | several of the following characteristics:
              tr.m-data-table__row
                td.m-data-table__entry.m-data-table__xxlr-borders.m-data-table__hanging01(align='left', valign='top', rowspan='1', colspan='1')
                  | They have taken benzodiazepines in prescribed “therapeutic” (usually low) doses for
                  | months or years.
              tr.m-data-table__row
                td.m-data-table__entry.m-data-table__xxlr-borders.m-data-table__hanging01(align='left', valign='top', rowspan='1', colspan='1')
                  | They have gradually come to “need” benzodiazepines to carry out normal, day-to-day
                  | activities.
              tr.m-data-table__row
                td.m-data-table__entry.m-data-table__xxlr-borders.m-data-table__hanging01(align='left', valign='top', rowspan='1', colspan='1')
                  | They have continued to take benzodiazepines even though the original indication for
                  | the prescription has disappeared.
              tr.m-data-table__row
                td.m-data-table__entry.m-data-table__xxlr-borders.m-data-table__hanging01(align='left', valign='top', rowspan='1', colspan='1')
                  | Because of withdrawal symptoms, they have difficulty stopping use of the drug or reducing
                  | the dose.
              tr.m-data-table__row
                td.m-data-table__entry.m-data-table__xxlr-borders.m-data-table__hanging01(align='left', valign='top', rowspan='1', colspan='1')
                  | Those taking short-acting benzodiazepines have anxiety between doses or a craving
                  | for the next dose.
              tr.m-data-table__row
                td.m-data-table__entry.m-data-table__xxlr-borders.m-data-table__hanging01(align='left', valign='top', rowspan='1', colspan='1') They contact their doctor regularly to obtain repeat prescriptions.
              tr.m-data-table__row
                td.m-data-table__entry.m-data-table__xxlr-borders.m-data-table__hanging01(align='left', valign='top', rowspan='1', colspan='1')
                  | They become anxious if the next prescription is not readily available; they may carry
                  | their tablets around with them and may take an extra dose before an event that is
                  | anticipated to be stressful or before spending the night in a strange bed.
              tr.m-data-table__row
                td.m-data-table__entry.m-data-table__xxlr-borders.m-data-table__hanging01(align='left', valign='top', rowspan='1', colspan='1') They may have increased the dosage since the original prescription.
              tr.m-data-table__row
                td.m-data-table__entry.m-data-table__xxlr-borders.m-data-table__hanging01(align='left', valign='top', rowspan='1', colspan='1')
                  | They may have anxiety symptoms, panic attacks, agoraphobia, insomnia, depression,
                  | or increasing physical symptoms, despite continuing to take benzodiazepines.
              tr.m-data-table__row
                td.m-data-table__entry.m-data-table__xxlr-borders.m-data-table__hanging01(align='left', valign='top', rowspan='1', colspan='1') Doctor-shopping, emergency visits, and lost prescriptions are common.
              tr.m-data-table__row
                td.m-data-table__entry.m-data-table__xxlr-borders.m-data-table__hanging01(align='left', valign='top', rowspan='1', colspan='1')
                  | They use private prescriptions rather than those for which the cost would be reimbursed
                  | by health insurance.
              tr.m-data-table__row
                td.m-data-table__entry.m-data-table__xblr-borders.m-data-table__hanging01(align='left', valign='top', rowspan='1', colspan='1') They take hypnotic agents during the day.
